Exact cover (each support entry hit by exactly one rank-1 term) is a BARRIER, not a search tool:
- n=2: exact-cover rank = 8 (schoolbook), true rank = 7 (Strassen). Gap = 1.
- n=4: exact-cover rank = 49 (Strassen recursive), AlphaTensor = 47. Gap = 2.
- Any improvement over compositional methods REQUIRES interference (multi-hit on support entries).
- Lacelle 2026 (arXiv:2606.13408) proves composition methods = exact cover (non-overlap theorem).
- The search must allow interference; exact cover reproduces known compositional results only.

Burnside orbit counting + residual cascade measurement + orbit classification of decompositions
give us a potential definition for orbit-reduced interference search in constructions of matmul
schemes that beat the naive-Strassen constructions.
